cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Computational Simulation of the Wilberforce Pendulum"
abstract: >-
  A modular Fortran 2008 package that integrates the coupled longitudinal-
  torsional equations of motion of a Wilberforce pendulum with a fourth-order
  Runge-Kutta scheme in quadruple precision, compares against the closed-form
  normal-mode solution, tracks energy conservation, and includes an interactive
  3D simulator and a strategy to measure the coupling constant.
type: software
